{{- /*
GitHub Copilot CLI: ~/.copilot/mcp-config.json, the user-scope MCP servers.

tmux: the tmux MCP server (spawn_subagent, wait_subagents, list_panes,
message_agent, ...; see ~/code/tmux-mcp/README.md). Wired here for the
external-subagents feature (plan U9).

Why stdio and not the shared HTTP server on 127.0.0.1:7998:
  The HTTP server wants `Authorization: Bearer <token>`, with the token in
  ~/.local/state/tmux-mcp/token. Copilot (checked on 1.0.114) can only send
  static `headers` from this file, with ${VAR} expansion from its own
  environment. It has no token-file or headers-helper option for MCP (the
  dynamic headers in its SDK belong to embedding hosts, not this file), and
  no shell exports the token. Writing the header here would inline the
  secret, which this repo never does. So Copilot runs its own copy of the same
  server over stdio (`server.ts --stdio`, the transport the test suite
  uses). A local child process needs no token. Same tools; the caller's tab
  comes from TMUX_PANE when Copilot passes its env on, otherwise from process
  ancestry (Copilot -> bun).
  Cost: one bun process per Copilot session, idle between calls.

env: PATH and TMUX_MCP_HIDE_SESSIONS match the LaunchAgent
(com.mackhaymond.tmux-mcp), so tmux and agent-spawn resolve the same way.
timeout: wait_subagents blocks up to 540 s, so allow 600 s per call.

Managed by chezmoi (the .chezmoiignore exception `!.copilot/mcp-config.json`).
`copilot mcp add` also writes to this file, so add any other server here,
or `chezmoi apply` will drop it.
Without MCP, Copilot still has the CLI: `agent-spawn` and
~/.agents/skills/tmux-workspace/scripts/tmux-mcp-call.py.
*/ -}}
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "tmux": {
      "type": "local",
      "command": {{ joinPath .chezmoi.homeDir ".bun/bin/bun" | toJson }},
      "args": [
        {{ joinPath .chezmoi.homeDir "code/tmux-mcp/src/server.ts" | toJson }},
        "--stdio"
      ],
      "env": {
        "PATH": "/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin",
        "TMUX_MCP_HIDE_SESSIONS": "agents,stash,scratch,tasks",
        "LANG": "en_US.UTF-8"
      },
      "tools": ["*"],
      "timeout": 600000
    }
  }
}
